      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从她脱口而出的话来推断，\n应该是在烦恼要送给朋友的礼物吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dbcd1c1221a2271a014746abd036e21397bda20cdcdebee966dfe05f58342d",
